r”.\n\n4. Block or mark as spam (alternative)\n   - Open an Uber message, click the three-dot menu, choose “Block [sender]” or “Report spam” (spam moves messages automatically to Spam).\n\nIf you use Gmail app (Android/iOS)\n- Search for “uber”, tap the profile icons to select messages, then tap the trash icon to delete.\n- To block or report: open a message, tap the three-dot menu and choose “Block” or “Report spam”.\n- To create filters you’ll need to use Gmail on the web (desktop).\n\nIf you use Outlook, Apple Mail, or another provider\n- Use their search for “uber” to find messages, select and delete in bulk.\n- Create a Rule/Filter (e.g., From contains “uber”) to auto-delete or move to a folder.\n\nWant help?\n- Tell me which email provider you use (Gmail, Outlook, etc.) and whether you want messages automatically deleted or just archived. I can give the exact search string and step-by-step tailored to that provider.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_012ed9d67e6fae99016a9a08bae52087d0b3c13085fd330250","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[{"description":"Synthetic Gmail connector.","name":"gmail","output_schema":null,"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["send","forward","draft","archive","delete"],"type":"string"},"body":{"type":"string"},"include_attachments":{"type":